## Total cost

Total cost for 220 people is two venue days plus 660 hotel room nights (220 rooms for 3 nights).

chart hbar cities x=city y=total cost unit=€ labels focus="Prague" title="Total cost for 220 people"

## Trade-offs

!! Krakow is the cheapest at 97720 euros, but its largest room seats only 190, fewer than the 220 attendees. It is out.

- Prague costs only 2820 euros more than Athens, and its flight is 1.6 hours shorter.
- Prague's largest room seats 260, enough for all 220 attendees.
- Dublin is the most expensive at 182440 euros.

## Recommendation

Choose Prague: 119480 euros in total, only 2820 euros more than Athens, with a flight 1.6 hours shorter.
